    "title": "Cale Makar notches 3 points in Avalanche rout of Flames | Sports | lufkindailynews.com",
    "text": "Cale Makar scored twice in a three-point game in his hometown and both Devon Toews and Jaden Schwartz notched a pair of goals to lead the visiting Colorado Avalanche to a 7-3 victory over the Calgary Flames on Thursday.\nNathan MacKinnon scored once and added two assists for the Avalanche, who have won three of four games to start the season.",
